{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2023-05-26 09:20:00', 'title': "LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. ANNOUNCES 5% INCREASE TO QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C. , MAY 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF ONE DOLLAR AND 10 CENTS ($1.10) PER SHARE, PAYABLE AUG. 9, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JULY 26, 2023."}